      "explanation": [
        "Main idea: absetzen is a separable verb: setzt ab, setzte ab, hat abgesetzt. It means to put down (a bag, a rucksack) or to drop off a passenger from a vehicle.",
        "In politics and at work, absetzen means to remove from office: einen Minister absetzen. In medicine it means to stop taking a drug: ein Medikament absetzen. In tax matters it means to deduct from tax: von der Steuer absetzen.",
        "Reflexively, sich absetzen means to separate oneself or to escape: Die Diebe haben sich abgesetzt."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "de": "Setz bitte den Rucksack ab.",
          "lv": "Please put your rucksack down."
        },
        {
          "de": "Der Bus setzt die Kinder vor der Schule ab.",
          "lv": "The bus drops the children off at the school."
        },
        {
          "de": "Der Minister wurde abgesetzt.",
          "lv": "The minister was removed from office."
        },
        {
          "de": "Sie hat das Medikament abgesetzt.",
          "lv": "She stopped taking the medication."
        },
        {
          "de": "Du kannst die Reisekosten von der Steuer absetzen.",
          "lv": "You can deduct the travel costs from your tax."
        }
      ],
      "comparison": [
        {
          "word": "abstellen",
          "meaning": "to park, to put down",
          "example": "Er stellt das Auto ab. – He parks the car."
        },
        {
          "word": "absagen",
          "meaning": "to cancel",
          "example": "Sie sagen das Treffen ab. – They are cancelling the meeting."
        },
        {
          "word": "ablegen",
          "meaning": "to put down, to take off",
          "example": "Sie legt die Jacke ab. – She takes off her jacket."
        }
      ],
      "tip": [
        "An official is removed with absetzen, an event is cancelled with absagen.",
        "In a taxi: Setzen Sie mich am Bahnhof ab – drop me off at the station."
      ],
      "important": [
        "absetzen has many meanings: the object determines the meaning (Rucksack, Minister, Medikament, Kosten).",
        "The prefix ab- separates in a sentence: Ich setze dich vor der Schule ab."
      ],
