        "Main idea: die Einführung is a feminine noun. It means an introduction (an opening section, a beginners’ course, an introductory lecture) or the introduction of something new (a system, law or product). Plural: die Einführungen.",
        "Common constructions: Einführung in + accusative (an introduction to a subject): eine Einführung in die Physik; Einführung + genitive: die Einführung des Euro (the introduction of the euro). The related verb is einführen."
