        "Main idea: das Los is a lot or ticket: a slip of paper or token that is drawn to find out a prize or to decide who has to do what. The plural is die Lose, the genitive des Loses.",
        "Figuratively, das Los is fate, the future that destiny has in store for a person: ein schweres Los. The phrase das große Los ziehen means to win the jackpot or to have great luck.",
        "Literally, things are decided by lot: das Los entscheidet, durch das Los. Do not confuse it with the adjective lose (loose) and the exclamation los! (go!)."
