        "Main idea: die Spitze is a feminine noun meaning a pointed end or top: Bleistiftspitze, Bergspitze. Figuratively it means leadership or first place: an der Spitze stehen.",
        "The plural is die Spitzen. Common phrases: an der Spitze (at the head), die Spitze des Berges (the summit), die Spitze des Eisbergs (the tip of the iceberg), die Tabellenspitze (the top of the table).",
