        "Main idea: werben means to advertise: to promote a product or service, as in für ein Produkt werben. Forms: wirbt, warb, hat geworben. Construction with für + accusative: Die Firma wirbt für ihr neues Produkt.",
        "With um + accusative, werben means to try to win: um Kunden werben, um jemanden werben (to court someone's favour). It also means to recruit: Freiwillige werben (to recruit volunteers). The noun is die Werbung (advertising)."
