        "Main idea: der Beruf is a masculine noun meaning the occupation by which a person earns a living, usually after training.",
        "The plural is die Berufe. Important combinations: Was sind Sie von Beruf? (What is your profession?), einen Beruf ausüben (to practise a profession), einen Beruf wählen (to choose a career), im Beruf (at work, in professional life).",
